      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7475834::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7475834::web::004::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial silicide coating has an outer high-silicon MSi2 layer and an inner M5Si3 layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7475834::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7475834::web::020::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature oxidation transforms the coating into an outer oxide layer and an inner silicide layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7475834::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7475834::web::020::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The inner silicide layer remains structurally largely stable during oxidation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7475834::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7475834::web::020::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The outer oxide is primarily SiO2 mixed with metal oxides.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating develops a self-healing silicide or oxide layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The silicide coating acts as a silicon reservoir.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7475834::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7475834::web::020::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Silicon diffuses to the surface to form a continuous, adherent SiO2-rich scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The SiO2-rich scale limits further oxygen ingress.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The self-healing scale preserves the alloy's structural integrity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coated alloy will have a significantly lower oxidation rate and mass gain than untreated MoNbTaTiW after prolonged exposure at 900–1000°C in air.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7475834::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7475834::web::004::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coated alloy will develop a more continuous and adherent scale than the untreated alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated refractory HEAs develop rapid, non-protective oxide scales and substantial mass gain under the stated conditions.",
